<title>USA: Irvine Apartment names Mcfarland CEO.</title>
<headline>Irvine Apartment names Mcfarland CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irvine Apartment Communities said Wednesday it named William McFarland its president and chief executive, effective July 15.</p>
<p>McFarland, 57, has guided all the company's homebuilding activities since 1984, the company said.</p>
<p>He assumes the titles and responsibilities from Donald Bren, who will remain chairman of the company.</p>
</text>
